                                                "sense_id": "f7245666-47b8-31d0-b8c7-5c2ac134763f",
                                                "text": "The Guatemalans offered United Fruit $627,572 (about $2.99 an acre) in compensation, a figure that came from the company's own tax value assessment for the land."
